      "family_id": "family_76da67ef5320",
      "description": "A compact implementation-and-verification collaboration pattern in which an integration-focused member maps requirements onto existing extension points, a developer produces the change, and a verifier checks behavior, placement, compatibility, and documentation against repository evidence. It is suitable for bounded cross-file changes with clear acceptance criteria, but not for broad architectural redesigns or investigations requiring extensive domain-specialist analysis.",
      "current_template_id": "tpl_family_76da67ef5320_aae9c576",
      "handoff_family_id": "hf_family_76da67ef5320",
      "created_at": "2026-09-03T02:52:49.846407+00:00",
